    "# September 11 Support Session: Python Repair\n",
    "\n",
    "**COMPSS 211A | Fall 2026 | Student copy**\n",
    "\n",
    "**Friday, September 11, 2026**\n",
    "\n",
    "Today we will learn how to read a Python error, find a misspelled column name, and make a clear choice about a missing value. The records are made up for practice."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "76433aa7c600495a",
   "metadata": {
    "tags": []
   },
   "source": [
    "## Before we start\n",
    "\n",
    "Click a code cell and press **Shift + Enter**. Work from top to bottom. The setup is grouped in one cell; each lesson code cell has one line.\n",
    "\n",
    "This is a no-AI practice session. Ask your neighbor or the instructor when you get stuck."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "6d46b869bdf897ad",
   "metadata": {
    "tags": []
   },
   "source": [
    "## Setup check\n",
    "\n",
    "Run this cell once. It loads the packages, creates our made-up practice table, checks the versions, and shows the Python and folder this notebook is using.\n",
    "\n",
    "The local course setup uses Python **3.13**, pandas **2.2.3**, and NumPy **2.1.3**."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "9acbec4f65b95248",
   "metadata": {
    "tags": [
     "setup"
    ]
   },
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "import platform\n",
    "import sys\n",
    "from pathlib import Path\n",
    "import pandas as pd\n",
    "import numpy as np\n",
    "\n",
    "tiny = pd.DataFrame({\"place\": [\"Doe\", \"Moffitt\", \"D-Lab\", \"Main Stacks\", \"Ethnic Studies\"], \"seats\": [40, None, 18, 65, 12], \"visitors\": [120, 95, None, 150, 40]})\n",
    "\n",
    "print(\"Python version:\", platform.python_version())\n",
    "print(\"Python 3.13:\", platform.python_version().startswith(\"3.13.\"))\n",
    "print(\"pandas version:\", pd.__version__)\n",
    "print(\"pandas matches 2.2.3:\", pd.__version__ == \"2.2.3\")\n",
    "print(\"NumPy version:\", np.__version__)\n",
    "print(\"NumPy matches 2.1.3:\", np.__version__ == \"2.1.3\")\n",
    "print(\"Python location:\", sys.executable)\n",
    "print(\"Working folder:\", Path.cwd())"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "607758a63844dc7b",
   "metadata": {
    "tags": []
   },
   "source": [
    "If you see an import error or a version check says `False`, show the result to the instructor or GSI. Colab versions may differ, so ask before changing packages.\n",
    "\n",
    "## 1. Look at the table\n",
    "\n",
    "Run each line, then tell your neighbor what the result shows."
   ]
  },
